rscalex99 O.\charscalex100  \charscalex99 OLUFISAYO.\charscalex100\par\pard\sl-150\sb9\fs15\par\pard\li2160\sl240\slmult1\f8\fs28\b1 MINISTERS\'92 PROFILE\b0\par\pard\fi720\ri67\qj\sl259\slmult1\sb25\f18\fs22\b1 Apostle Goke Ogunleye \f14\b0 is a New Testament minister. He is the president\f14  of Alleluia to Jesus Ministries, the General overseer of Jesus faith Christian chapel.\f14  He serves as a life coach, trainer and covering to many ministers is in the body of\f14  Christ. He hold a weekly programme tagged faith trumpet church on air and other\f14  outreaches such as believer faith seminar which holds Bi-monthly.\par\pard\sl-150\sb9\fs15\par\pard\ri67\qj\sl258\slmult1\f14\fs22\b0 He   is   a   missionary   by   calling,   teaching   and   preaching   majorly   on   faith   and\f14  redemption.  His  apostolic,  prophet  and  teaching  ministry  has  greatly  impacted\f14  people  live.  His  wife  \f18\b1 Rev.  Mrs  Subomi  Ogunleye  \f14\b0 works  together  with  him  in\f14  ministry  and  they  are  blessed  with  three  children.  They  reside  in  Osogbo,  Osun\f14  State, Nigeria.\par\pard\sl-160\sb4\fs16\par\pard\fi720\ri73\qj\sl239\slmult1\f18\fs19\b1\charscalex99 Apostle\charscalex100  \charscalex99 Oluwafunminiyi\charscalex100  \charscalex99 Samson\charscalex100  \charscalex99 Olufisayo\f14\b0 is\charscalex100  \charscalex99 an\charscalex100  \charscalex99 ordained\charscalex100  \charscalex99 minister\charscalex100  \charscalex99 of\charscalex100  \charscalex99 the\charscalex100  \charscalex99 gospel\charscalex100  \charscalex99 called\f14  and\charscalex100   \charscalex99 sent\charscalex100   \charscalex99 from\charscalex100   \charscalex99 God\charscalex100   \charscalex99 as\charscalex100   \charscalex99 a\charscalex100   \charscalex99 conference\charscalex100   \charscalex99 speaker\charscalex100   \charscalex99 and\charscalex100   \charscalex99 life\charscalex100   \charscalex99 trainer\charscalex100   \charscalex99 with\charscalex100   \char